{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14287","headline":"晨游昌师院 · 窦羣","name":"晨游昌师院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深庭芳草浓，晓井山泉溢。\n林馥乱沈烟，石润侵经室。\n幽岩鸟飞静，晴岭云归密。\n壁藓凝苍华，竹阴满晴日。\n生期半宵梦，忧绪仍非一。\n若无高世心，安能此终毕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦羣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}